0010: # In the input you will see grey horizontal and vertical bars that divide rectangular regions. Each rectangular region is black with some colored pixels added.
0011: # To make the output, fill the rectangular region with the most colored pixels. Fill it with is color. Fill the other rectangular regions with black.   
